<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore's income tax rates stay unchanged.</title>
<headline>Singapore's income tax rates stay unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Finance Minister Richard Hu said on Friday income tax rates will remain unchanged.</p>
<p>As income tax and corporate tax rates were reduced last year and will take effect from year of assessment 1997, there was no need to reduce rates, Hu said in his budget speech.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
